      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait what do you mean by a goblin treasure hoard? i'm just trying to figure out the tax stuff. can you just explain the actual IRS rules for home office equipment and depreciation? i need to know if i can write off the whole thing this year or if i have to spread it out.",
